\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Placement forensics. \textbf  {A} LIBERO-Object's identity-bearing targets, $10$ tasks $\times $ $50$ shipped states; six collapse to a point and the ten task means occupy two clusters $22.1$\,cm apart. \textbf  {B} LIBERO-Spatial on identical axes: every target scatters, and it must, because all ten of its targets are a ``black bowl'' and identity cannot disambiguate them. \textbf  {C} placement radius per task against the tolerance measured for this controller. Generated by \texttt  {paper/render\_fig1\_placement\_forensics.py}; SHA-256 digests of every init-state array are in \texttt  {results/suite\_forensics\_columns.json}.}}{4}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
