\newlabel{fig:dataflow}{{5}{9}{Every edge coloured by what it carries. The architectural half of the argument is a code fact: \texttt {GraspPointHead.forward} takes no text argument, so no red edge reaches object selection, approach or grasping, and every red edge terminates in one $(x,y)$ latched once per episode and never re-read}{figure.caption.36}{}}
